  <h2>Text Messaging Program</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Program name:</strong> McKenney Electric Co Appointment Notifications
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Program description:</strong> Customers who opt in receive text
    messages about their inquiries and electrical service appointments,
    including replies, quotes, booking confirmations, appointment reminders,
    job updates, and notices about rescheduled or cancelled appointments.
    Reminder messages may ask you to reply YES to confirm or NO to cancel.
    Text messaging is not for emergencies.
  </p>

  <h2>How You Opt In</h2>
  <p>You can opt in either of these ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>By texting us:</strong> Send a text to the number on our{" "}
      <a href="/text-us/">Text Us</a> page. By texting that number, you agree
      to receive text messages from us about your inquiry.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>By phone:</strong> After you book an appointment by phone, we may
      ask whether you would like text messages about it. We tell you that
      message and data rates may apply and that you can reply STOP at any time.
      You are enrolled only if you clearly say yes.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Agreeing to receive texts is not required to buy any goods or services from
    us.
  </p>

  <h2>Message Frequency and Cost</h2>
  <p>
    Message frequency varies based on your inquiries and appointments. Message and data rates
    may apply. Check your mobile plan or contact your carrier for details.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Opt Out</h2>
  <p>
    Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to cancel. You can also use
    STOPALL, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, or QUIT. You will receive a message
    confirming that you have been unsubscribed. To join again, reply{" "}
    <strong>START</strong> or <strong>UNSTOP</strong>.
  </p>

